## Quando o OAuth `user-supabase` falha

Erros típicos: *Organization unavailable*, *connection timeout*, projecto errado (`arixmswqxnojnyvokqsv`).

**Não insistir no OAuth.** Aplicar migrations e queries via **Management API**:

```bash
./scripts/apply-supabase-migration.sh supabase/migrations/NNN_nome.sql
```

Ou `POST https://api.supabase.com/v1/projects/vmyezkbkthguojmxhacw/database/query` com o PAT de `.cursor/mcp.json`.

